      "writtenOn": "2025-01-16T03:07:13Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Does `-Zno_codegen` add anything useful given that we\u0027re already only emitting metadata? There\u0027s no object file being produced. If it does, we might want to add it to the other clippy build rule too, but I think it\u0027s not actually helpful here.",
      "revId": "d0e2eb1e5e3e66035cc506f14867a2a295dcc594",
